-- An EITHER input, read by l4 batch (review of #779, 2026-11-17).
-- A bare value used to reach the rule without its side, so the CONSIDER fell
-- through to OTHERWISE and the claim of 2000 answered 50.

DECLARE Box HAS v IS AN EITHER STRING NUMBER

@export default Fee for a claim
GIVEN `the claim` IS AN EITHER STRING NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
fee MEANS
  CONSIDER `the claim`
  WHEN RIGHT amount THEN amount * 0.05
  OTHERWISE 50

@export Fee for a boxed claim
GIVEN b IS A Box
GIVETH A NUMBER
`boxed fee` MEANS fee WITH `the claim` IS b's v
